From: vsajjadx <vsajjadx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 17:49:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Control endpoint and launch args for the shadPS4
 integration

--window attaches the capture to one window at startup (the switch the
keyboard's window key takes), --ctl opens a line-based TCP endpoint on
127.0.0.1 whose words are the same commands the tray queue takes (nr, fg,
boost, reload, quit), and --instance names the single-instance mutex so a
launcher's copy can run beside the user's tray copy. 'reload' re-reads the
config another program wrote and applies each change through the path its
own control takes.
